om/v/t64.5771-25/491821799_1191477622448986_335158506262625688_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=meIdkuz9cyIQ7kNvwGqNlu_&_nc_oc=AdpINocyjKqPLrfSuYDVSRHXP0j9lDustOqCAMwNyIa7so-HdjIbPto5ClTw66Fg81g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRapWjsG8nF5mbNrOBu1PmAQu_Ot9wZbBscKbFIXQIJ2A&oe=6B05C177"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "1014885264124822", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819375_1014885267458155_4732627606674535666_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EuyP6G3StZcQ7kNvwF6wBgA&_nc_oc=AdqXekekG-EqLFIt1HeD8mAsXZXNWr5mnyh7CZ2POWcQn_RR691XSMD2lsv5BFXv2ZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTZRGZLGYLPub9WyfF40bPPeNQwr9ktnATmKFw5iTQKsg&oe=6B05AB25"}, {"file_name": "screenshot2.png", "id": "592606743148111", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391923_592606746481444_8966562253819213417_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dymkS4NqJi4Q7kNvwG6lNDb&_nc_oc=Adq2DJpN-LlucloCX6cgV0YK9nZ37iZ1TDVq9UMW1Fk3Uc8vwx7z5HWQhEYEDIGiiZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQh5tV4lzgWOmxAzTtK19-rY_XszuJFA2xX7wobagUcoA&oe=6B05B655"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "3508709025927990", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391985_3508709029261323_3016583868344724243_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GfczYeksXYUQ7kNvwGBJtPN&_nc_oc=Adq86R6maRHriNZ1WIbEn7p9ejMUGkSVjq-sjneg0EK6Wr0w9fgjsdV6tlCuCBkTmUs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQStMVp5G77nZW8tT8wY87jUSJUhjSlJuTFHXYH6tQsiNA&oe=6B05C067"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1333140684643275", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391976_1333140687976608_7978945902575114739_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E5JZHMClirsQ7kNvwG0kO1e&_nc_oc=AdqWWd9MbaR9WCZgNsrLfR1rpY3Q-U2dKjZIdKwk_kaCgoAM6-wvwCUFXQIr65Y-GE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRHr9XSycoBv-waw1daba2TwawWzCNTQGuqss4rNo3MyA&oe=6B05C4D0"}, "display_name": "Fit Beat Combat : Free Style Boxing", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Boxing"], "long_description": "# Catch the Rhythm, Punch Your Way to Fit in VR!\n\nTired of boring workouts? Ready to **truly enjoy** getting fit? Welcome to **Fit Beat Combat Boxing**! Experience an exhilarating **VR fitness game** on Meta Quest where rhythm meets power! This isn't just another game \u2013 it's your personal boxing ring, high-energy dance floor, and path to a healthier, stronger you. An addictive **VR workout** challenge!\n\n# Feel the Beat, Land the Punch!\n\nDynamic VR arenas meet heart-pumping music. Simple controls: put on your Quest headset (2, 3, or Pro) & move! Notes sync to infectious beats. Unleash your inner champion! **Jab, cross, hook, and uppercut** notes with precision. **Duck and weave** past obstacles, keeping your body moving and heart rate soaring. Intuitive, exhilarating, fun **full-body workout** to make you sweat! Perfect for cardio and calorie burning!\n\n# Your Personal Coach Awaits!\n\nYou're not alone. Our expert **virtual instructor** guides form, pushes you, & cheers you on. Learn technique and feel the burn. Adapts for **beginners** to **fitness pros** to keep you motivated.\n\n# Workout Your Way!\n\nDitch boring apps & gyms! **Fit Beat Combat Boxing** is your fun, effective fitness routine. Smash beats to reach goals like **weight loss**, boosting **stamina**, improving **coordination**, or **stress relief**!\n\n# Key Features:\n\n- **Rhythm Boxing Gameplay:** Punch, duck, dodge to music! Music & exercise.\n- **Full-Body Workout:** Arms, core, legs workout for max calorie burn.\n- **Engaging Soundtrack:** Energizing music keeps you moving.\n\n\n", "short_desc